这份等待挪到了朋友身上。不是你太敏感，是那个小孩一直在等一个确定的答案。说到这里，你心里最先冒出来的是什么感觉？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"原来那份害怕，是从很小的时候就住进心里了——家里少了那个不会走的人，你就把这份等待挪到了朋友身上。不是你太敏感，是那个小孩一直在等一个确定的答案。说到这里，你心里最先冒出来的是什么感觉？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2281,"promptTokens":2360,"completionTokens":124,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:43:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"caa56639537b45f7b977dfc7539d67d4","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0124280161988275,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa7bd64a7028114331c4ae","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800598302,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:43:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa7bd64a7028114331c4ae","chatId":"b709a92982ae416fb46e566d03480c1f","sessionId":null,"userId":100431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最早……可能跟我爸妈有关吧。他们很早就离婚了，我跟着我妈。那时候家里总说朋友最重要，可我心里其实一直在等一个人不要走。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0124280161988275,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":5,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6afa7bd64a7028114331c4af","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800598299,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:43:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa7bd14a7028114331c4a6","chatId":"b709a92982ae416fb46e566d03480c1f","sessionId":null,"userId":100431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"那种“最后总会被留下一个人”的预感，像是心里早就写好的结局，所以你在关系里总是提着心。这样的害怕通常有它最早的来处。你愿意试着回想一下，这种感觉最早是和谁有关吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那种“最后总会被留下一个人”的预感，像是心里早就写好的结局，所以你在关系里总是提着心。这样的害怕通常有它最早的来处。你愿意试着回想一下，这种感觉最早是和谁有关吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3105,"promptTokens":2797,"completionTokens":220,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:43:13"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"7aa9cad21fa845e9bf9844325a02cf82","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010985747336053227,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa7bd14a7028114331c4a5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800593800,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:43:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa7bd14a7028114331c4a5","chatId":"b709a92982ae416fb46e566d03480c1f","sessionId":null,"userId":100431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……谢谢你这么说。以前的事，我一时也不知道从哪儿讲。就是那种……总觉得自己会被留下来的那个人丢下的感觉吧。<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提